    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# | echo: false\n",
        "# Import necessary libraries\n",
        "from services import snowflake_queries as sq\n",
        "from components import graph_utils as gu, constraint_utils as cu\n",
        "import plotly.graph_objects as go\n",
        "from services.database_connection import init_connection\n",
        "from itables import show, JavascriptFunction\n",
        "import ipywidgets as widgets\n",
        "from IPython.display import Image, display\n",
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "conn=init_connection()"
      ],
      "id": "75ec70b0",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 📈 Evolution de la load et du vents\n",
        "- La LoadMin est plus adapté au début du mois, le LoadMax l'est plus vers la fin du mois.\n",
        "- Le LoadMax diminue au courant du mois.\n",
        "- Au début (1-7 septembre) et à la fin du mois (22-30 septembre) la différence entre le daily et le monthly (8-21 septembre) est plus petit qu'au milieu du mois.\n",
        "- La génération totale est cyclique."
      ],
      "id": "953669b3"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| code-fold: true\n",
        "\n",
        "market = 'NYPP'\n",
        "start_date = '2025-09-01'\n",
        "end_date = '2025-09-30'\n",
        "\n",
        "df_Load=sq.get_Load([f'{market}_1DA_Default', f'{market}_1MA_Default', f'{market}_1MA_LoadMin',f'{market}_1MA_LoadMax']\n",
        "                  ,'2020-01-01'\n",
        "                  ,end_date\n",
        "                  ,conn\n",
        "                  )"
      ],
      "id": "51c45318",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "- La génération de vent n'est pas cyclique.\n",
        "- Le monthly et le daily pour le vent sont similaieres au scénario WindMin au milieu du mois, mais ils diffèrent pour le reste du mois (11-20 septembre)."
      ],
      "id": "1c420db2"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| code-fold: true\n",
        "df_Wind=sq.get_Wind([f'{market}_1DA_Default',f'{market}_1MA_Default',f'{market}_1MA_WindMin',f'{market}_1MA_WindMax']\n",
        "                  ,'2020-01-01'\n",
        "                  ,end_date\n",
        "                  ,conn\n",
        "                  )\n",
        "\n",
        "gu.create_graph_load(df_Load,'TOTAL',start_date,end_date)\n",
        "gu.create_graph_wind(df_Wind,start_date,end_date)"
      ],
      "id": "365b97f3",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 𝄜 Top contraintes du mois"
      ],
      "id": "037d7359"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| code-fold: true\n",
        "\n",
        "df_PM=sq.get_PostMortem(1\n",
        "                        ,start_date\n",
        "                        ,end_date\n",
        "                        ,[f'{market}_1MA_Default', f'{market}_1MA_AvgHistSP', f'{market}_1MA_DL_AvgSP',\n",
        "                        f'{market}_1DA_Default', f'{market}_1DA_AvgHistSP', f'{market}_1DA_DL_AvgSP',]\n",
        "                        ,conn)\n",
        "\n",
        "df_PM.fillna(0,inplace=True)\n",
        "exclude_columns = [\"CID_MAG\", \"CID_CES\", \"CONSTRAINTNAME\",\"CONTINGENCYNAME\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "# Apply formatting to all other columns\n",
        "for col in df_PM.columns:\n",
        "    if col not in exclude_columns:\n",
        "        df_PM[col] = df_PM[col].apply(lambda x: f\"${x:,}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# Apply formatting to all other numeric columns\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "show(df_PM,\n",
        "    classes=\"compact\",\n",
        "    column_filters=\"header\", \n",
        "    layout={\"topEnd\": None}, \n",
        "    style=\"font-size: 12px;\",\n",
        "    )"
      ],
      "id": "7da759d0",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
